WEBVTT

00:10.800 --> 00:14.430
<b>I suppose that I’m the epitome of a fool.</b>

00:26.900 --> 00:29.320
<b>I wanted to make you happy.</b>

00:45.710 --> 00:49.960
<b>The tragedy that happened 2,000 years ago is over.</b>

00:50.590 --> 00:53.760
<b>We’re going to get it all back!</b>

02:24.810 --> 02:29.190
<b>10 - SEND HATRED TO THE PAST</b>

02:28.430 --> 02:31.810
<b><i>Traitor, Anos Voldigoad.</i></b>

02:32.810 --> 02:36.860
<b><i>I will now start executing one</i>
<i>white uniformed student at a time.</i></b>

02:36.860 --> 02:40.490
<b><i>If you wish to save them,</i>
<i>come to the arena alone.</i></b>

02:40.860 --> 02:43.620
<b><i>Looks like the Magic Sword of Destruction</i>
<i>will have to wait.</i></b>

02:43.910 --> 02:47.620
<b><i>If he was confident about taking you on,</i>
<i>he wouldn’t need hostages, right?</i></b>

02:47.910 --> 02:50.250
<b><i>Then he’s doing this to buy time?</i></b>

02:50.540 --> 02:52.130
<b><i>We’ll go, then.</i></b>

02:52.130 --> 02:53.040
<b><i>Fine.</i></b>

02:58.170 --> 03:00.550
<b><i>Magical tools that will thwart perception.</i></b>

03:00.550 --> 03:02.720
<b><i>I think you’ll be able</i>
<i>to infiltrate the execution site.</i></b>

03:03.340 --> 03:06.010
<b><i>Leave it to us.</i>
<i>Iris.</i></b>

03:09.980 --> 03:13.350
<b><i>I’m counting on you two</i>
<i>to rescue the other students.</i></b>

03:13.350 --> 03:14.610
<b><i>Gotcha.</i></b>

03:14.610 --> 03:16.480
<b><i>I’ll do my best.</i></b>

03:17.570 --> 03:21.070
<b>You should come with me, Lena.
The Spirit King awaits.</b>

03:22.450 --> 03:23.160
<b>Okay.</b>

03:44.340 --> 03:46.430
<b>Now, then, let’s get started.</b>

03:46.430 --> 03:51.270
<b>Until the Misfit arrives,
I will kill you one by one.</b>

03:52.770 --> 03:56.810
<b><i>If Meleheyth and that teacher are the only ones</i>
<i>who could give us trouble, now’s our—</i></b>

03:57.190 --> 03:58.110
<b><i>Wait.</i></b>

04:00.150 --> 04:01.280
<b><i>Are they onto us?</i></b>

04:01.650 --> 04:06.030
<b><i>We’re good. They’re probably waiting</i>
<i>for us to make a move.</i></b>

04:06.030 --> 04:08.660
<b><i>No false moves, then, right?</i></b>

04:08.990 --> 04:10.700
<b>- Nihid.
- Sir?</b>

04:10.700 --> 04:12.040
<b>Start with her.</b>

04:14.330 --> 04:15.040
<b>Huh?</b>

04:15.040 --> 04:16.880
<b>N-No way! Why me?</b>

04:16.880 --> 04:20.050
<b>That would be because you’re not a Royal.</b>

04:21.710 --> 04:23.010
<b>Please wait a minute!</b>

04:23.420 --> 04:26.090
<b>I’m Aramis Eltimo, a third year.</b>

04:27.180 --> 04:29.720
<b>If you’re going to execute her,
let me take her place!</b>

04:29.720 --> 04:32.020
<b>You’ve been reincarnated, I see.</b>

04:32.230 --> 04:37.400
<b>I’m a Hero. I’m far more your enemy
than a hybrid demon!</b>

04:37.690 --> 04:41.940
<b>Fine. Then I shall be happy
to do as you wish.</b>

04:42.740 --> 04:45.450
<b>Nihid. Take him to the scaffold.</b>

04:46.490 --> 04:49.160
<b>Playing the hero—pretty hilarious.</b>

05:00.460 --> 05:01.380
<b><i>Menou.</i></b>

05:02.590 --> 05:04.380
<b><i>Did you find out where they are?</i></b>

05:04.380 --> 05:05.300
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

05:05.840 --> 05:08.050
<b><i>Avos Dilhevia is in the Ceremony Room.</i></b>

05:08.430 --> 05:10.760
<b><i>The Spirit King is in the Throne Room.</i></b>

05:11.010 --> 05:14.020
<b><i>But I couldn´t locate NousGalia.</i></b>

05:14.020 --> 05:17.810
<b><i>Good enough. Do you know where</i>
<i>the students are being held captive?</i></b>

05:17.810 --> 05:20.730
<b><i>Yes. Though they’re scattered</i>
<i>across multiple sites.</i></b>

05:20.940 --> 05:24.190
<b><i>Then show Eleonore and Zeshia the way.</i></b>

05:24.190 --> 05:25.320
<b><i>Understood.</i></b>

05:27.070 --> 05:30.240
<b><i>Why are the Spirit King</i>
<i>and Avos in separate locations?</i></b>

05:30.240 --> 05:33.330
<b><i>They must want to split us up.</i></b>

05:33.330 --> 05:37.750
<b><i>As she has the Demon King’s lore,</i>
<i>the Spirit God Sword must not agree with her.</i></b>

05:37.750 --> 05:42.130
<b><i>Meaning that the Avos in the Ceremony Room</i>
<i>might be NousGalia in disguise?</i></b>

05:42.130 --> 05:42.920
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

05:43.300 --> 05:47.430
<b><i>But we don’t have much time.</i>
<i>Splitting up might be our best bet.</i></b>

05:47.430 --> 05:49.930
<b><i>That’s exactly what he wants us to think.</i></b>

05:51.300 --> 05:52.970
<b>There’s something here!
Get ready!</b>

05:53.260 --> 05:54.390
<b>Fire!</b>

05:57.480 --> 05:58.480
<b>Hero Kanon!</b>

05:59.730 --> 06:00.690
<b>Damn!</b>

06:02.440 --> 06:07.360
<b>What are you doing with Lord Shin’s magic sword?</b>

06:11.030 --> 06:11.950
<b>Lady Luche!</b>

06:12.200 --> 06:13.620
<b>Curse you!</b>

06:14.080 --> 06:15.660
<b>You fools.</b>

06:22.750 --> 06:27.090
<b>Just as I thought, the demons from 2,000 years ago
are highly susceptible to brainwashing.</b>

06:27.340 --> 06:28.880
<b>Wait there until further notice.</b>

06:28.880 --> 06:32.180
<b>The demera that binds you
will be dispelled eventually.</b>

06:32.930 --> 06:36.930
<b>Lay, I’m heading to the Throne Room.
You take the Ceremony Room.</b>

06:36.930 --> 06:37.770
<b>Understood.</b>

06:42.770 --> 06:45.530
<b>Lena, wait here until the time comes.</b>

06:46.570 --> 06:47.280
<b>Okay.</b>

06:55.700 --> 06:59.210
<b>So we meet at last, Avos Dilhevia.</b>

07:05.750 --> 07:07.880
<b>I’m impressed that you were able
to recognize me.</b>

07:08.130 --> 07:12.090
<b>No matter where I go,
you’ll always end up showing yourself to me.</b>

07:12.760 --> 07:15.140
<b><i>It’s the same thing that I did before.</i></b>

07:15.140 --> 07:16.140
<b><i>In other words...</i></b>

07:18.390 --> 07:22.230
<b>I should’ve stayed hidden until you appeared.</b>

07:22.600 --> 07:26.690
<b>So the one who went to the Ceremony Room
is fake, I suppose?</b>

07:26.690 --> 07:30.320
<b>I divided three of my sources,
so you could say they’re somewhat real.</b>

07:31.740 --> 07:36.410
<b>I already know everything,
so it doesn’t matter what you do.</b>

07:36.740 --> 07:38.290
<b>Take a look at this.</b>

07:39.290 --> 07:44.210
<b>2,000 years ago, this student
was actually Igareth Ijeiska, wasn’t he?</b>

07:49.300 --> 07:51.670
<b>I am now going to have him executed.</b>

07:52.800 --> 07:55.850
<b>Are you that afraid of taking me on for real?</b>

07:56.140 --> 07:57.760
<b>Avos Dilhevia?</b>

08:02.190 --> 08:04.940
<b>If you’re buying time so that you can seize
the Magic Sword of Destruction...</b>

08:04.940 --> 08:06.020
<b>...that’s what you’d say.</b>

08:06.190 --> 08:08.860
<b>You’re certainly adept at provocation.</b>

08:09.230 --> 08:12.820
<b>Nihid, carry out the execution.</b>

08:25.580 --> 08:29.630
<b><i>We’ll have to neutralize them all at once,</i>
<i>or the hostages won’t be safe.</i></b>

08:29.920 --> 08:33.670
<b>The Demonic Eyes of Destruction could do it...
but it’ll take too much time.</b>

08:33.670 --> 08:37.140
<b><i>I’ll go on a no-holds-barred rampage to divert them.</i>
<i>So in the meantime...</i></b>

08:37.510 --> 08:39.560
<b><i>I’ll time it to you, Sasha.</i></b>

08:40.100 --> 08:43.980
<b>It’s the least we can do for you.
Do you have any last words?</b>

08:44.520 --> 08:49.730
<b>Avos Dilhevia is a fake!
I know the true Demon King!</b>

08:50.150 --> 08:54.530
<b>And he was both kind and strong...
He would never discriminate!</b>

08:54.990 --> 08:58.070
<b>Why did you all forget that?</b>

09:00.580 --> 09:02.200
<b>Are those your last words?</b>

09:02.540 --> 09:04.460
<b>I have fulfilled my mission.</b>

09:06.000 --> 09:07.290
<b>I have no regrets.</b>

09:10.040 --> 09:14.550
<b><i>I believe that the true Demon King</i>
<i>will bring about genuine peace!</i></b>

09:15.220 --> 09:16.550
<b><i>Is that so?</i></b>

09:29.610 --> 09:31.400
<b>I totally agree!</b>

09:44.790 --> 09:46.210
<b>Nihid.</b>

09:47.580 --> 09:52.630
<b>I hope you haven’t forgotten that revolting
against the Demon King means death.</b>

09:52.960 --> 09:56.840
<b>Revolt? Nihid?
What are you talking about?</b>

09:57.720 --> 09:59.390
<b>My name is Davidra!</b>

09:59.930 --> 10:04.640
<b>For 2,000 years, my king has always been
none other than Lord Anos Voldigoad!</b>

10:04.770 --> 10:10.480
<b>All demons from 2,000 years ago should
have pledged their loyalty to Avos Dilhevia.</b>

10:10.480 --> 10:14.730
<b>Why would they betray such a beloved figure?</b>

10:14.900 --> 10:19.610
<b>Beloved? All that brainwashing seems
to have sprung leaks everywhere.</b>

10:20.360 --> 10:23.740
<b>Have you even switched our sense
of obligation to Lord Anos over to Avos?</b>

10:25.580 --> 10:29.330
<b>Just because you’ve gained a single ally
doesn’t make it any less futile.</b>

10:29.330 --> 10:30.120
<b>Gaios!</b>

10:30.370 --> 10:32.380
<b>Execute those white uniforms!</b>

10:34.000 --> 10:35.920
<b>All right, time to die.</b>

10:40.890 --> 10:43.050
<b>Come on, what a slowpoke!</b>

10:43.300 --> 10:44.510
<b>Wh-What?</b>

10:44.680 --> 10:46.100
<b>Jio Graze!</b>

10:47.810 --> 10:51.020
<b>But... you’re nothing but a white uniform!</b>

10:51.270 --> 10:54.320
<b>2,000 years ago, you wouldn’t have
given me the time of day, would you?</b>

10:54.320 --> 10:57.360
<b>I’m Neon Armelka.
Nice to meet you.</b>

11:01.530 --> 11:03.160
<b>- Jio Graze!
- Jio Graze!</b>

11:07.330 --> 11:14.790
<b>You’re only struggling in vain.
Even if you’re demons from 2,000 years ago!</b>

11:19.380 --> 11:20.470
<b>Do you have the magic sword?</b>

11:24.850 --> 11:28.100
<b>Who would’ve thought he’d save
the one who tried to kill him?</b>

11:33.730 --> 11:35.900
<b>But you saved me, too.</b>

11:37.400 --> 11:41.400
<b>I’m sure that even you haven’t forgotten what
the humans did, right?</b>

11:46.200 --> 11:49.160
<b>I left my hatred 2,000 years in the past!</b>

11:50.290 --> 11:51.750
<b>Damn!</b>

11:55.210 --> 11:58.090
<b>This couldn’t be more annoying!</b>

12:04.050 --> 12:06.050
<b>The traitor’s subordinates!</b>

12:07.470 --> 12:08.850
<b>Ice Cat.</b>

12:20.820 --> 12:22.610
<b><i>All right, let’s get out of here!</i></b>

12:23.570 --> 12:26.030
<b>Looks like this is the extent of your control.</b>

12:26.370 --> 12:30.620
<b>I’d advise you not to get carried away
after winning just one round.</b>

12:34.620 --> 12:37.380
<b>These girls are in separate buildings.</b>

12:38.170 --> 12:41.760
<b>I’d say they have, oh, another five minutes
before they draw their last breaths?</b>

12:42.090 --> 12:43.760
<b>Oh? Then what?</b>

12:44.010 --> 12:48.800
<b>Your remaining subordinates are Eleonore,
Zeshia, and Menou.</b>

12:48.800 --> 12:51.640
<b>You won’t have enough time
to save them all in five different places.</b>

12:51.970 --> 12:54.980
<b>Did you already forget what you just saw?</b>

12:54.980 --> 12:57.610
<b>You never know, I might have
even more reincarnated subordinates.</b>

12:57.860 --> 13:00.020
<b>Don’t try to bluff me.</b>

13:00.020 --> 13:03.360
<b>Your reincarnated subordinates
were only able to coordinate their actions...</b>

13:03.360 --> 13:05.320
<b>...thanks to a series of coincidences.</b>

13:05.320 --> 13:07.280
<b>And that won’t happen again.</b>

13:07.280 --> 13:09.990
<b>Now, then, go rescue them.</b>

13:09.990 --> 13:14.040
<b>When you return,
I’ll be happy to take you on.</b>

13:14.040 --> 13:16.580
<b>With your pride and joy, Venuzdnor.</b>

13:16.920 --> 13:21.130
<b>You’re right, under these circumstances
it would be difficult to coordinate.</b>

13:21.840 --> 13:24.340
<b>But there is one good way to do so.</b>

13:26.550 --> 13:28.300
<b>Isn’t that right, Davidra?</b>

13:28.300 --> 13:32.060
<b><i>Fraudulent Demon King.</i>
<i>Do you know Anoshu Polticoal?</i></b>

13:32.970 --> 13:34.850
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

13:40.360 --> 13:41.520
<b>That’s our code word.</b>

13:42.730 --> 13:44.940
<b>Which only our allies know.</b>

13:46.240 --> 13:47.740
<b>Anoshu Polticoal.</b>

13:49.490 --> 13:53.450
<b>That’s how we were able to signal
to each other without being noticed.</b>

13:53.450 --> 13:55.830
<b>Surely there were far too many
of the reincarnated...</b>

13:55.830 --> 13:59.670
<b>...who conveniently regained
their memories and powers at this time?</b>

14:02.250 --> 14:04.090
<b>I hereby order those under my rule.</b>

14:04.090 --> 14:06.050
<b>To join Eleonore.</b>

14:06.050 --> 14:10.050
<b>She should be able to protect those
without stamina from the demera spell.</b>

14:10.390 --> 14:11.680
<b><i>- As you wish!</i>
<i>- As you wish!</i></b>

14:12.180 --> 14:13.430
<b><i>Gotcha!</i></b>

14:15.720 --> 14:17.980
<b>Anos Voldigoad...</b>

14:27.360 --> 14:30.030
<b>Right... it’s quite clear to me now.</b>

14:31.320 --> 14:32.990
<b>You’ve changed the past, haven’t you?</b>

14:33.240 --> 14:36.700
<b>Now that you know,
you might as well get serious about this.</b>

14:37.200 --> 14:38.660
<b>Or else...</b>

14:41.040 --> 14:44.380
<b>You’ll meet your demise without
it ever becoming a battle.</b>

14:45.840 --> 14:51.340
<b>Are you sure about that?
I still know everything that’s going to happen.</b>

14:52.140 --> 14:58.180
<b>All right, Hero Kanon. Let me see you
slash me with that Spirit God Sword!</b>

14:59.520 --> 15:04.230
<b>Just finish it off once and for all.
Along with her sorrowful destiny.</b>

15:06.730 --> 15:07.820
<b>Is that a Gennul?</b>

15:12.660 --> 15:15.200
<b>Hmm, inside the Spirit of Vanishment, then?</b>

15:16.620 --> 15:18.080
<b>That is correct.</b>

15:22.540 --> 15:25.000
<b>It’s been a long time, Lord Anos.</b>

15:27.840 --> 15:30.880
<b>I have... betrayed you.</b>

15:31.220 --> 15:33.720
<b>The Sword of Severance, Deltoros, eh?</b>

15:33.720 --> 15:36.180
<b>You wouldn’t draw that one
unless you were dead serious.</b>

15:36.470 --> 15:39.730
<b>Shin. What’s your reason for fighting?</b>

15:43.310 --> 15:45.310
<b>You know everything, I see.</b>

15:45.690 --> 15:50.820
<b>Yes. What I don’t understand
is why you would point your blade at me.</b>

15:52.280 --> 15:54.450
<b>I’m going to destroy Avos Dilhevia...</b>

15:54.870 --> 15:59.950
<b>But I’m going to save Misa, no matter what.
That should settle everything.</b>

16:04.920 --> 16:08.170
<b>I was sure that you would say just that.</b>

16:08.460 --> 16:14.050
<b>Shin. Had I been there that day,
I would’ve ordered you to do the same thing.</b>

16:14.590 --> 16:19.770
<b>You haven’t changed at all in
the last 2,000 years... you’re my right-hand man.</b>

16:21.350 --> 16:25.730
<b>Then... I would like to receive
your mercy in my last moments.</b>

16:26.520 --> 16:28.110
<b><i>Let’s pick up where we left off that night.</i></b>

16:28.650 --> 16:32.650
<b><i>Both putting our lives on the line...</i>
<i>I wish to challenge you.</i></b>

16:33.280 --> 16:35.160
<b><i>You want to die?</i></b>

16:35.160 --> 16:38.370
<b><i>I am the Demon King’s right-hand man.</i>
<i>Now and forever.</i></b>

16:39.160 --> 16:42.580
<b><i>I cannot allow myself</i>
<i>to be killed by anyone but you.</i></b>

16:43.960 --> 16:47.630
<b>2,000 years ago,
I protected Misa from the shadows.</b>

16:48.130 --> 16:50.880
<b>And I pointed my sword at you...</b>

16:50.880 --> 16:52.800
<b>...so that the lore about the Demon King
of Tyranny would never fade away.</b>

16:53.130 --> 16:56.470
<b>And now, her true self has awakened.</b>

16:56.470 --> 17:00.390
<b>As long as you’re here,
Misa will surely be saved.</b>

17:02.560 --> 17:04.390
<b>Since then,
I’ve been on a journey.</b>

17:05.640 --> 17:10.110
<b>I’ve been to various places.
And then... I heard them.</b>

17:11.030 --> 17:18.740
<b><i>Rumors, here and there, about one who was kind</i>
<i>to the spirits, always had a smile on her face.</i></b>

17:20.080 --> 17:22.200
<b><i>If only she’d never fallen in love with me,</i>
<i>who had no love to give...</i></b>

17:23.750 --> 17:26.210
<b><i>If only I’d never sought love...</i></b>

17:29.170 --> 17:32.380
<b>“Maybe she’s still here somewhere...”</b>

17:35.590 --> 17:40.890
<b>For 2,000 years, in order to atone for it all,
I’ve lived in disgrace.</b>

17:45.730 --> 17:48.310
<b>This is my final request, my lord.</b>

17:48.310 --> 17:52.780
<b>Please bring an end to these empty days
by your own hand.</b>

18:02.030 --> 18:05.410
<b>Shin. My loyal subordinate.</b>

18:05.830 --> 18:08.750
<b>I thank you for living through hell
for 2,000 years.</b>

18:09.290 --> 18:11.040
<b>I’m proud of you.</b>

18:15.510 --> 18:17.260
<b>You remember our promise, right?</b>

18:19.430 --> 18:21.640
<b>Take my right arm with you.</b>

18:22.050 --> 18:26.930
<b>If this is the end, then take back your dignity,
and rest in peace.</b>

18:27.480 --> 18:29.770
<b>I’ll send you to where she is.</b>

18:30.440 --> 18:34.110
<b>For someone who has nothing,
this couldn’t be a finer parting gift.</b>

18:34.110 --> 18:36.530
<b>I am deeply grateful to you for your mercy.</b>

18:45.200 --> 18:46.410
<b>Sword of Severance...</b>

18:46.830 --> 18:49.000
<b>Third Hidden Art, End...</b>

18:50.670 --> 18:54.380
<b>I poured my entire soul into this sword,
which I spent my entire life perfecting.</b>

18:54.800 --> 18:57.090
<b>Then let me see what you’ve got.</b>

19:16.110 --> 19:18.360
<b>You can’t slice it off, can you, Shin?</b>

19:32.540 --> 19:34.840
<b>Some things are just beyond me.</b>

19:35.090 --> 19:40.720
<b>No, you couldn’t sever it because you tried
to be a demon, rather than a sword.</b>

19:43.510 --> 19:47.350
<b>Shin. 2,000 years ago,
you went through hell.</b>

19:47.810 --> 19:51.980
<b>2,000 years ago,
I would’ve saved you in the form of death.</b>

19:52.440 --> 19:54.020
<b>Just as you would’ve wanted.</b>

20:02.700 --> 20:05.870
<b>In this era,
I happen to have a father.</b>

20:06.660 --> 20:08.830
<b><i>You wouldn’t believe what a nitwit he is.</i></b>

20:09.160 --> 20:11.830
<b><i>I can’t even count how many times he’s been</i>
<i>the subject of public ridicule.</i></b>

20:12.160 --> 20:13.210
<b><i>But...</i></b>

20:14.080 --> 20:16.040
<b>My father loves me.</b>

20:16.460 --> 20:19.380
<b>No matter what happens,
that’s the one unchanging fact in my life.</b>

20:19.710 --> 20:23.300
<b>And that’s also the most important thing.</b>

20:26.090 --> 20:30.100
<b>If, for example, my father was in
the very depths of hell...</b>

20:30.100 --> 20:34.140
<b>And even if I hadn’t yet found a way
to rescue him from that hell...</b>

20:34.690 --> 20:38.980
<b>Still, I could never utter the words,
“I’ll let you die with dignity.”</b>

20:39.360 --> 20:42.860
<b>No matter how much he may be suffering,
I still want him to live.</b>

20:44.200 --> 20:48.580
<b>Live, Shin. Would you rob Misa of her father?</b>

20:58.380 --> 21:00.800
<b>Would she ever...</b>

21:03.260 --> 21:05.970
<b>...acknowledge me as her father?</b>

21:06.300 --> 21:08.470
<b>Who else but you can call himself her father?</b>

21:13.680 --> 21:15.390
<b><i>Misa was always gazing at it.</i></b>

21:15.940 --> 21:18.270
<b><i>The half of the demon sword that you gave her.</i></b>

21:18.770 --> 21:23.190
<b><i>Believing it to be a message</i>
<i>from her silent father, she’s been waiting.</i></b>

21:23.530 --> 21:25.450
<b><i>For you to come get her.</i></b>

21:34.710 --> 21:36.040
<b>My lord.</b>

21:37.920 --> 21:41.800
<b>You’ve become even stronger, sterner...</b>

21:41.800 --> 21:43.460
<b>and kinder than before.</b>

23:35.580 --> 23:39.960
<b>TO SEVER THAT FATE</b>

23:36.740 --> 23:39.290
<b><i>To Sever That Fate.</i></b>
